       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-SKYRMION-TOPOLOGICAL-SYNAPSE-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SKYRMION-TOPOLOGY-STATE.
           05  WS-CHIRALITY-INDEX          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOPOLOGICAL-CHARGE-Q     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DZYALOSHINSKII-MORIYA    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FET-DISCHARGE-ALIGNED    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-NON-VOLATILE-WEIGHT-MET  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SKYRMION-PROOF-FLAGS.
           05  WS-HOMOTOPY-PI2-SOUND       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ENERGY-BARRIER-STABLE    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SKYRMION-TOTAL-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-HOMOTOPY-CHARGE.
           PERFORM 2000-VERIFY-FET-DISCHARGE-COUPLING.
           PERFORM 3000-VERIFY-ENERGY-STABILITY.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-SKYRMION-PROOF.
           GOBACK.
       1000-VERIFY-HOMOTOPY-CHARGE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CHIRALITY-INDEX.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TOPOLOGICAL-CHARGE-Q.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HOMOTOPY-PI2-SOUND.
       2000-VERIFY-FET-DISCHARGE-COUPLING.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DZYALOSHINSKII-MORIYA.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FET-DISCHARGE-ALIGNED.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NON-VOLATILE-WEIGHT-MET.
       3000-VERIFY-ENERGY-STABILITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ENERGY-BARRIER-STABLE.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-SKYRMION-PROOF.
           IF WS-HOMOTOPY-PI2-SOUND = 1 AND
              WS-FET-DISCHARGE-ALIGNED = 1 AND
              WS-NON-VOLATILE-WEIGHT-MET = 1 AND
              WS-ENERGY-BARRIER-STABLE = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SKYRMION-TOTAL-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-SKYRMION-TOTAL-CODE.
